{
    "m_SGVersion": 0,
    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "24a5fff3439fed2da6ced167f12865e7",
    "m_Title": "Como leer este grafo",
    "m_Content": "Pulsa A para ver todo el grafo (F centra la seleccion).\nLos datos viajan de IZQUIERDA a DERECHA hasta el Master Stack (a la derecha del todo).\nCada recuadro numerado es un PASO; la nota amarilla de su izquierda lo explica.\nLos circulos/cuadros dentro de los nodos son vistas previas del valor en ese punto.",
    "m_TextSize": 1,
    "m_Theme": 0,
    "m_Position": {
        "serializedVersion": "2",
        "x": -330.0,
        "y": -540.0,
        "width": 700.0,
        "height": 330.0
    },
    "m_Group": {
        "m_Id": ""
    }
}

{
    "m_SGVersion": 0,
    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "979bd272bbbb93957a9aa84b67a516d7",
    "m_Title": "1 \u00b7 Cuanto disolver",
    "m_Content": "Boolean + Branch: manual (slider) o automatico (triangulo que sube y baja con el tiempo).",
    "m_TextSize": 1,
    "m_Theme": 0,
    "m_Position": {
        "serializedVersion": "2",
        "x": -430.0,
        "y": 0.0,
        "width": 380.0,
        "height": 262.0
    },
    "m_Group": {
        "m_Id": "8ff9a44be6e5b146dba2d7984050396a"
    }
}

{
    "m_SGVersion": 0,
    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "378b665d73d9d4c4ec1952a54d433911",
    "m_Title": "2 \u00b7 Ruido",
    "m_Content": "Un ruido 0..1 decide QUE zonas desaparecen primero. Branch elige posicion local o de mundo.",
    "m_TextSize": 1,
    "m_Theme": 0,
    "m_Position": {
        "serializedVersion": "2",
        "x": -430.0,
        "y": 880.0,
        "width": 380.0,
        "height": 262.0
    },
    "m_Group": {
        "m_Id": "dc81e594f61d597f8bf81d7abfb1e16d"
    }
}

{
    "m_SGVersion": 0,
    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "f32f36271c28bdd8b0c5d8ba304c00ae",
    "m_Title": "3 \u00b7 Umbral y recorte",
    "m_Content": "cut = d*(1+ancho) - ancho. Donde ruido < cut: Alpha 0 (se corta).",
    "m_TextSize": 1,
    "m_Theme": 0,
    "m_Position": {
        "serializedVersion": "2",
        "x": -430.0,
        "y": 1610.0,
        "width": 380.0,
        "height": 234.0
    },
    "m_Group": {
        "m_Id": "1c0f355ba421b780a6421018f0d40302"
    }
}

{
    "m_SGVersion": 0,
    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "5dea8c86e4bba41bfbb2533b05d227a2",
    "m_Title": "4 \u00b7 Borde brillante",
    "m_Content": "Zona justo antes de cortarse: (n - cut)/ancho cerca de 0 -> brilla con EdgeColor (Emission).",
    "m_TextSize": 1,
    "m_Theme": 0,
    "m_Position": {
        "serializedVersion": "2",
